mg class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/1cf5b380105d3822859aaf40f7f974d9.avif?t=1787921812\" width=616 height=490 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable costumes / skins. Lots varieties of options to choose to make your character looks prettier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Generated Level</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/6d12fdff4275f78508c45b0b8e21cc83.avif?t=1787921812\" width=616 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generate map segments to allow different path taken toward objectives area inside underground dungeon</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RNG Arsenals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/08d447d644e601487898f71bde2c3a04.avif?t=1787921812\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random generate gun &amp; powerups or loot-able for grinding. Lots of guns and about 56++ nano-plugin addon powerups skills with lots of random stats that can be obtainable. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >..And Many more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1758950/extras/65933dec28846ab26790adce8331fc2a.avif?t=1787921812\" width=616 height=179 /></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banzai Escape 2 Subterranean is a sequel game based on the events of Banzai Escape 2 where the Draugr labs have been captured by SPECTRE. All of the sisters (Inchester, Imingter and Iekler) take in refugees to a location deep underground. In order to survive, they must defeat the Lanun occupying the underground dungeon networks along with other factions such as SPECTRE and others</p><p cl